 "widget": "<div class=\"tcf-page tcf-scope tcf-p-ctec-requirements\"><div id=\"tcf-ctec-requirements-root\" class=\"tcf-root\">@@SSR@@</div></div>\n<template id=\"tcf-ctec-requirements-tpl\">\n\n\n<div data-screen-label=\"CTEC Requirements\" class=\"tcf-screen\">\n  \n  <div style=\"position:relative;overflow:hidden;color:#fff;padding:110px 56px 100px\">\n    <img src=\"@@MEDIA:photos/ctec-org-desktop.webp@@\" alt=\"\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(11,46,64,.96) 0%,rgba(11,46,64,.88) 55%,rgba(11,46,64,.78) 100%)\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.07) 0%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 55%);\"></div>\n    <div style=\"position:relative;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;max-width:820px\">\n      <span style=\"align-self:flex-start;border:1px solid rgba(108,190,69,.5);color:#95AB3B;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 14px;font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase\">Resources</span>\n      <h1 style=\"margin:0;font:300 64px/1.05 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em\"><span style=\"display:block\">CTEC Requirements</span><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:800\">for California <span style=\"color:#95AB3B\">Tax Preparers</span></span></h1>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.55;color:rgba(255,255,255,.82);max-width:640px;text-wrap:pretty\">What you need to register as a CRTP for the first time, what you need every year to renew, and the dates and fees that matter.</p>\n    </div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"height:6px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#95AB3B,#7E9330)\"></div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;padding:88px 56px\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px\">\n      <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:36px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(11,46,64,.06)\">\n        <div style=\"font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">New preparers</div>\n        <h2 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px/1.15 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em\">60-Hour Qualifying Education</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652\">Required once, before your first CTEC registration. Must be completed with a CTEC-approved provider.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px\"><div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">43 hrs</div><div style=\"font-size:19px;color:#5A6E78\">Federal tax law</div></div><div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">2 hrs</div><div style=\"font-size:19px;color:#5A6E78\">Ethics</div></div><div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">15 hrs</div><div style=\"font-size:19px;color:#5A6E78\">California tax law</div></div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;line-height:1.5;color:#8A9AA3\">CTEC describes this as 45 federal hours; that figure includes the 2 hours of ethics.</div>\n        <div style=\"font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;margin-top:4px\">Then, to register:</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:22px;color:#2F4652\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\"><span style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">✓</span>Obtain a PTIN from the IRS</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\"><span style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">✓</span>Purchase a $5,000 tax preparer surety bond</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\"><span style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">✓</span>Pass a Live Scan background check</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\"><span style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">✓</span>Register with CTEC and pay the registration fee</div></div>\n        <a href=\"/ctec-60-hour-course/\" style=\"margin-top:auto;display:block;text-align:center;background:#0B2E40;color:#fff;font:700 22px Manrope,sans-serif;padding:14px;border-radius:8px\" data-hv=\"10\">Compare 60-hour courses</a>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:36px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(11,46,64,.06)\">\n        <div style=\"font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">Renewing preparers</div>\n        <h2 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px/1.15 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em\">20-Hour Continuing Education</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652\">Required every year to renew your CTEC registration. Hours must be reported to CTEC by your provider.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px\"><div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">10 hrs</div><div style=\"font-size:19px;color:#5A6E78\">Federal tax law</div></div><div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">3 hrs</div><div style=\"font-size:19px;color:#5A6E78\">Federal tax updates</div></div><div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">2 hrs</div><div style=\"font-size:19px;color:#5A6E78\">Ethics</div></div><div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">5 hrs</div><div style=\"font-size:19px;color:#5A6E78\">California tax law</div></div></div>\n        <div style=\"font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;margin-top:4px\">Then, to renew:</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:22px;color:#2F4652\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\"><span style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">✓</span>Renew your PTIN with the IRS</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\"><span style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">✓</span>Keep your $5,000 bond current</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\"><span style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">✓</span>Renew with CTEC and pay the renewal fee</div></div>\n        <a href=\"/#find-schools\" style=\"margin-top:auto;display:block;text-align:center;background:#95AB3B;color:#fff;font:700 22px Manrope,sans-serif;padding:14px;border-radius:8px\" data-hv=\"4\">Compare 20-hour courses</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:72px 56px 0\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,55fr) minmax(0,45fr);gap:40px;align-items:center\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\"><div style=\"font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">Education requirements</div><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 52px/1.1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em\">One course to qualify, <span style=\"font-weight:800\">one course every year after.</span></h2><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty\">Qualifying education is taken once, before you register. Continuing education repeats every year you stay registered. Both must come from a CTEC-approved provider, and the provider reports your completed hours to CTEC. Course completion is separate from the registration or renewal application itself.</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a href=\"/ctec-60-hour-course/\" style=\"border:1.5px solid #0B2E40;color:#0B2E40;font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;padding:11px 18px;border-radius:8px\" data-hv=\"9\">60-hour course guide</a><a href=\"/ctec-20-hour-course/\" style=\"border:1.5px solid #0B2E40;color:#0B2E40;font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;padding:11px 18px;border-radius:8px\" data-hv=\"9\">20-hour course guide</a></div></div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;padding:0 0 18px 0;padding-right:18px\"><div style=\"position:absolute;right:-18px;bottom:-18px;width:70%;height:70%;border-radius:22px;background:#E4F3DC\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:-26px;top:-26px;width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:16px;background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#F4F6F7 0%,#E9EFF6 100%);opacity:.7\"></div><img src=\"@@MEDIA:photos/04-tax-forms-calculator-closeup.webp@@\" alt=\"Hand using a calculator beside tax forms and an open textbook.\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:3/2;display:block;border-radius:22px;position:relative;box-shadow:0 28px 60px rgba(11,46,64,.18)\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:88px 56px\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:32px\">\n      <div style=\"text-align:center\"><div style=\"font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330;margin-bottom:10px\">Key dates</div><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:800 52px/1.1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em\">The renewal timeline</h2></div>\n      <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:20px\">\n        <div style=\"border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><div style=\"font:800 19px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#7E9330\">Nov 1 – Oct 31 · CE cycle</div><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">Earn your 20 hours</div><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.55;color:#2F4652\">Complete 20 CE hours any time in the cycle. Your provider reports completions to CTEC; reporting speed varies by school.</p><div style=\"margin-top:6px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB\"><div style=\"font:800 19px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#7E9330\">Aug 1 – Oct 31 · Renewal application</div><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.55;color:#2F4652\">The renewal application opens August 1. Submit it, with current PTIN and bond, by October 31.</p></div></div>\n        <div style=\"border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><div style=\"font:800 19px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#C48A00\">Nov 1 – Jan 15</div><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">Late renewal</div><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.55;color:#2F4652\">Renewal is still possible with a late fee added to the standard registration fee.</p></div>\n        <div style=\"border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><div style=\"font:800 19px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#C0392B\">After Jan 15</div><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">Registration lapses</div><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.55;color:#2F4652\">You must retake the 60-hour qualifying course and register as a new preparer.</p></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 22px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.55;color:#5A6E78\">Hour breakdowns, fees and dates are summarized from CTEC's published requirements and can change. Always confirm current rules on <a href=\"https://www.ctec.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-weight:700\">CTEC.org</a>.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  \n</div>\n  <sc-if value=\"{{ subOpen }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n  <div style=\"position:fixed;right:24px;bottom:24px;z-index:80;width:380px;max-width:calc(100vw - 32px);background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(11,46,64,.28);overflow:hidden;font-family:'Source Sans 3',sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">\n    <div style=\"height:5px;background:#95AB3B\"></div>\n    <div onclick=\"{{ subClose }}\" title=\"Close\" style=\"position:absolute;top:14px;right:12px;width:36px;height:36px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;color:#5A6E78\" data-hv=\"7\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"></path></svg></div>\n    <div style=\"padding:26px 26px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\">\n      <div style=\"font:700 15px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">Monthly coupon codes</div>\n      <div style=\"font:800 26px/1.15 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em;padding-right:24px\">Get CTEC course coupon codes every month</div>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;color:#5A6E78\">New codes from different course providers each month, plus an alert when a sale starts. No spam, unsubscribe anytime.</p>\n      <sc-if value=\"{{ subDone }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\"><div style=\"background:#F3F5E6;border:1px solid #D7EDC8;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#7E9330\">You're in. Watch for this month's codes.</div></sc-if>\n      <sc-if value=\"{{ subPending }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ true }}\">\n      <form onsubmit=\"{{ subSubmit }}\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\">\n        <input type=\"email\" required=\"\" value=\"{{ subEmail }}\" onchange=\"{{ subChange }}\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" style=\"height:50px;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:10px;padding:0 16px;font:400 17px 'Source Sans 3',sans-serif;color:#0B2E40;outline:none;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\">\n        <button type=\"submit\" style=\"height:50px;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:#95AB3B;color:#fff;font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;cursor:pointer\" data-hv=\"6\">Send me the codes</button>\n      </form>\n      </sc-if>\n      <div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#8A9AA3\">By subscribing you agree to our <a href=\"/privacy-policy/\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">Privacy Policy</a>.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  </sc-if>\n</template>",
 "css": "body{margin:0;background:#fff;font-family:\"Source Sans 3\",system-ui,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40}a{color:#7E9330;text-decoration:none}a:hover{color:#7E9330}a:visited{color:#7E9330}a:active{color:#7E9330}a:focus{outline:none}html{scrollbar-gutter:stable}button,select{font:inherit}button:focus,select:focus,input:focus{outline:none}.dd-menu a{display:flex!important;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}.dd .dd-menu{display:none}.dd:hover .dd-menu,.dd:focus-within .dd-menu{display:block}",
 "ssr": "\n\n\n<div data-screen-label=\"CTEC Requirements\" class=\"tcf-screen\">\n  \n  <div style=\"position:relative;overflow:hidden;color:#fff;padding:110px 56px 100px\">\n    <img src=\"/assets/photos/ctec-org-desktop.webp\" alt=\"\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(11,46,64,.96) 0%,rgba(11,46,64,.88) 55%,rgba(11,46,64,.78) 100%)\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.07) 0%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 55%);\"></div>\n    <div style=\"position:relative;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;max-width:820px\">\n      <span style=\"align-self:flex-start;border:1px solid rgba(108,190,69,.5);color:#95AB3B;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 14px;font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase\">Resources</span>\n      <h1 style=\"margin:0;font:300 64px/1.05 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em\"><span style=\"display:block\">CTEC Requirements</span><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:800\">for California <span style=\"color:#95AB3B\">Tax Preparers</span></span></h1>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.55;color:rgba(255,255,255,.82);max-width:640px;text-wrap:pretty\">What you need to register as a CRTP for the first time, what you need every year to renew, and the dates and fees that matter.</p>\n    </div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"height:6px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#95AB3B,#7E9330)\"></div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;padding:88px 56px\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px\">\n      <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:36px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(11,46,64,.06)\">\n        <div style=\"font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">New preparers</div>\n        <h2 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px/1.15 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em\">60-Hour Qualifying Education</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652\">Required once, before your first CTEC registration. Must be completed with a CTEC-approved provider.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px\"><div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">43 hrs</div><div style=\"font-size:19px;color:#5A6E78\">Federal tax law</div></div><div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">2 hrs</div><div style=\"font-size:19px;color:#5A6E78\">Ethics</div></div><div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">15 hrs</div><div style=\"font-size:19px;color:#5A6E78\">California tax law</div></div></div><div style=\"font-size:19px;line-height:1.5;color:#8A9AA3\">CTEC describes this as 45 federal hours; that figure includes the 2 hours of ethics.</div>\n        <div style=\"font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;margin-top:4px\">Then, to register:</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:22px;color:#2F4652\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\"><span style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">✓</span>Obtain a PTIN from the IRS</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\"><span style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">✓</span>Purchase a $5,000 tax preparer surety bond</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\"><span style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">✓</span>Pass a Live Scan background check</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\"><span style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">✓</span>Register with CTEC and pay the registration fee</div></div>\n        <a href=\"/ctec-60-hour-course/\" style=\"margin-top:auto;display:block;text-align:center;background:#0B2E40;color:#fff;font:700 22px Manrope,sans-serif;padding:14px;border-radius:8px\" data-hv=\"10\">Compare 60-hour courses</a>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:36px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(11,46,64,.06)\">\n        <div style=\"font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">Renewing preparers</div>\n        <h2 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px/1.15 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em\">20-Hour Continuing Education</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652\">Required every year to renew your CTEC registration. Hours must be reported to CTEC by your provider.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px\"><div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">10 hrs</div><div style=\"font-size:19px;color:#5A6E78\">Federal tax law</div></div><div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">3 hrs</div><div style=\"font-size:19px;color:#5A6E78\">Federal tax updates</div></div><div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">2 hrs</div><div style=\"font-size:19px;color:#5A6E78\">Ethics</div></div><div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">5 hrs</div><div style=\"font-size:19px;color:#5A6E78\">California tax law</div></div></div>\n        <div style=\"font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;margin-top:4px\">Then, to renew:</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:22px;color:#2F4652\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\"><span style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">✓</span>Renew your PTIN with the IRS</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\"><span style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">✓</span>Keep your $5,000 bond current</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\"><span style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">✓</span>Renew with CTEC and pay the renewal fee</div></div>\n        <a href=\"/#find-schools\" style=\"margin-top:auto;display:block;text-align:center;background:#95AB3B;color:#fff;font:700 22px Manrope,sans-serif;padding:14px;border-radius:8px\" data-hv=\"4\">Compare 20-hour courses</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:72px 56px 0\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,55fr) minmax(0,45fr);gap:40px;align-items:center\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\"><div style=\"font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">Education requirements</div><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 52px/1.1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em\">One course to qualify, <span style=\"font-weight:800\">one course every year after.</span></h2><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty\">Qualifying education is taken once, before you register. Continuing education repeats every year you stay registered. Both must come from a CTEC-approved provider, and the provider reports your completed hours to CTEC. Course completion is separate from the registration or renewal application itself.</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a href=\"/ctec-60-hour-course/\" style=\"border:1.5px solid #0B2E40;color:#0B2E40;font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;padding:11px 18px;border-radius:8px\" data-hv=\"9\">60-hour course guide</a><a href=\"/ctec-20-hour-course/\" style=\"border:1.5px solid #0B2E40;color:#0B2E40;font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;padding:11px 18px;border-radius:8px\" data-hv=\"9\">20-hour course guide</a></div></div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;padding:0 0 18px 0;padding-right:18px\"><div style=\"position:absolute;right:-18px;bottom:-18px;width:70%;height:70%;border-radius:22px;background:#E4F3DC\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:-26px;top:-26px;width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:16px;background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#F4F6F7 0%,#E9EFF6 100%);opacity:.7\"></div><img src=\"/assets/photos/04-tax-forms-calculator-closeup.webp\" alt=\"Hand using a calculator beside tax forms and an open textbook.\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:3/2;display:block;border-radius:22px;position:relative;box-shadow:0 28px 60px rgba(11,46,64,.18)\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:88px 56px\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:32px\">\n      <div style=\"text-align:center\"><div style=\"font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330;margin-bottom:10px\">Key dates</div><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:800 52px/1.1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em\">The renewal timeline</h2></div>\n      <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:20px\">\n        <div style=\"border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><div style=\"font:800 19px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#7E9330\">Nov 1 – Oct 31 · CE cycle</div><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">Earn your 20 hours</div><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.55;color:#2F4652\">Complete 20 CE hours any time in the cycle. Your provider reports completions to CTEC; reporting speed varies by school.</p><div style=\"margin-top:6px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB\"><div style=\"font:800 19px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#7E9330\">Aug 1 – Oct 31 · Renewal application</div><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.55;color:#2F4652\">The renewal application opens August 1. Submit it, with current PTIN and bond, by October 31.</p></div></div>\n        <div style=\"border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><div style=\"font:800 19px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#C48A00\">Nov 1 – Jan 15</div><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">Late renewal</div><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.55;color:#2F4652\">Renewal is still possible with a late fee added to the standard registration fee.</p></div>\n        <div style=\"border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><div style=\"font:800 19px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#C0392B\">After Jan 15</div><div style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">Registration lapses</div><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.55;color:#2F4652\">You must retake the 60-hour qualifying course and register as a new preparer.</p></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 22px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.55;color:#5A6E78\">Hour breakdowns, fees and dates are summarized from CTEC's published requirements and can change. Always confirm current rules on <a href=\"https://www.ctec.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-weight:700\">CTEC.org</a>.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  \n</div>\n  \n"
}